            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nThere are at least two ways to make focused window more visible:\r\n\r\n- Customize [`MiniFilesTitleFocused`](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/c333187fcc76d7e772dac32c2a440a949fe34be4/doc/mini-files.txt#L95) highlight group to be more visible.\r\n- Make [width of focused window](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/c333187fcc76d7e772dac32c2a440a949fe34be4/doc/mini-files.txt#L541-L542) more noticeable.\r\n\r\nI think these options (together with already mentioned tweaking of preview window width) should be enough to resolve this.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
